        "created_at": "2016-03-01T21:55:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I don't like this any more or less than the purple, but the purple does throw back to her Rook City outfit, which I think is nice. However, I am becoming increasingly convinced that it looks way better without the side holes/patches. You did a nice job, I have to look really closely to find where you filled in the holes, and if I didn't know they were there I probably wouldn't notice at all.</p>",
