        "created_at": "2016-03-01T21:59:26.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Enh.&nbsp; I still think the upper left hip is kinda rough.&nbsp; The rest are fine, but doing the biggest area first was a mistake.&nbsp; I learned a lot from it, but as a result, the most obvious section is also the least-polished, which wasn't a great call.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>C'est la guerre.</p>",
